                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It may look really cool visually and maybe it will give the impression of some forgotten hidden gem, but yeah no, it's just.. okay...bad. Perhaps a remaster would give justice to this little late 90s oddity. Unfortunately Avenging falls under the \"hitscan enemies everywhere that WILL shoot at you IN LESS THAN 1 SECOND and you will spend most of it just cornering on walls with barely anytime to actually go around without abusing quicksaves\". It's a shame because as previously said on multiple reviews it definitely had potential to be something quite ahead of its time with its ideas. Not that the Dystopian thing is anything original but yeah it predates Half Life 2 themes, a lot of the city reminds a lot of the Dark'n'Gritty early development era. \n\nAlso fascinating that this isn't another Lithtech jank, apparently it is its own engine.",
